    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "If we don't turn on `showPrevious`, `getWidgetState` always returns the uiState in this branch without setting any `page` key. And if there is no pagination widget in the widget tree, then uiState never get to have `page`. So \"show more\" didn't work. (example: https://codesandbox.io/s/instantsearchjs-dmuu2?file=/src/app.js)",
